cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "QFabric: interactive quantum visuals for the web"
message: "If you use QFabric in your research or teaching, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Perera
    given-names: Hasarindu
repository-code: "https://github.com/maninresearch/qfabric"
abstract: >-
  QFabric is a declarative quantum visualization engine for the web: a set of
  framework-agnostic web components for showing quantum states, built on a
  tested state-vector math engine, with a markdown authoring layer and an Astro
  integration for building interactive quantum education sites.
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - visualization
  - education
  - web components
  - quantum information
license: Apache-2.0
